# Generated run artifacts produced by the recon-agent make targets. These are
# machine-local outputs, never committed:
#   coverage.out         -> written by `make test` (go test -coverprofile).
#   recon_resolved.jsonl -> written by `make demo` / `go run ./cmd` (the
#                           idempotent per-run resolved/escalated log; this is
#                           NOT the committed ground-truth corpus at
#                           eval/recon_corpus.jsonl).
#   recon_summary.json   -> written by `make demo` / `go run ./cmd` (the
#                           machine-readable one-shot run report of breaks in /
#                           auto-resolved / escalated / audit count).
/coverage.out
/recon_resolved.jsonl
/recon_summary.json
